---

<DocsLayout
  title="Sterium"
  description="Explore moon phases, planetary timing, correspondences, spells, grimoire work, vision boards, events, and personalized spiritual tools with Sterium."
>
  <main class="sterium-page">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Meet Sterium</p>

        <h1>Bring your spiritual practice, timing, study, and personal grimoire into one place.</h1>

        <p class="hero-text">
          Sterium is a spiritual practice companion built around the moving parts
          of real ritual, study, reflection, and timing. Follow the current moon,
          Sabbats, planetary day and hour, numerology, transits, correspondences,
          and lucky hours; generate or build spells and correspondence entries;
          keep a detailed grimoire; create vision boards; and organize meaningful
          events without splitting your practice across disconnected tools.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions" aria-label="Sterium links">
          <a class="primary-button raised-button" href="#features">
            Explore Features
          </a>

          <a class="secondary-button raised-button" href="/contact">
            Contact Support
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-showcase reveal reveal-delay">
        <div class="showcase-card main-card">
          <span class="mini-label">Your Practice in Sterium</span>

          <h4>Timing, correspondences, spellwork, and reflection stay connected.</h4>

          <div class="progress-line">
            <span></span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="floating-card floating-card-one">
          <span>Current Sky</span>
          <strong>Moon, transits, and planetary timing</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="floating-card floating-card-two">
          <span>Grimoire</span>
          <strong>Built-in and custom entry types</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <GradientDivider />

    <section class="intro-section reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">One Connected Practice</p>

      <h2>Your spiritual tools make more sense when timing, study, ritual, and reflection can inform one another.</h2>

      <p>
        Sterium connects daily spiritual context, correspondences, spells,
        grimoire entries, vision boards, and events into one personal system.
        Instead of treating each part of your practice as a separate app or
        notebook, you can keep the information, inspiration, and timing around
        your work together.
      </p>
    </section>

